# Impeccable adaptation notice

The bundled Impeccable skill and the modified files under `skills/impeccable/` are adapted from pbakaus/impeccable at commit `6496f49a1ea0503ca130d7dd55508dd0d22aa86b`, under Apache-2.0. Changes support portable cross-host plugin packaging, routing and workflow behavior.

The following modified data files have formats that cannot safely carry comments: `scripts/VERSION` (the pinned engine version) and `scripts/command-metadata.json` (the command metadata object). Both paths are relative to `skills/impeccable/`.

`scripts/data/font-index.json.deflate` is a gzip-compressed representation of the upstream `skill/scripts/data/font-index.json`: decompression reproduces the original bytes. The compressed representation is redistributed without modifying that data.
